This product includes shading functions adapted from DiligentFX
(https://github.com/DiligentGraphics/DiligentFX), part of Diligent Engine,
Copyright Diligent Graphics LLC, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

The adapted functions are the GGX normal distribution, the
height-correlated Smith visibility, Schlick Fresnel with a grazing
reflectance, the Lambert diffuse split by Fresnel and metalness, the
multiple-scattering composition of image-based lighting, the clear-coat
layering, the punctual-light record with its inverse-square falloff and
spot cone, and the PBR Neutral tone curve (which DiligentFX carries from
the Khronos Group, also under the Apache License, Version 2.0). They live, transcribed into
Slang, in apps/spell-circle-canvas/src/common/material/core/shaders/Shading.slang
and apps/spell-circle-canvas/src/common/world/diligent/shaders/Surface.slang.
